1
00:00:01,630 --> 00:00:03,550
好了 莉莉 11点上芭蕾课
Okay, Lily, ballet at 11:00,

2
00:00:03,550 --> 00:00:05,940
之后和小伙伴一起玩 3点有空手道课
then a playdate, then karate class at 3:00,

3
00:00:05,940 --> 00:00:07,420
你为什么不去拿训练服呢
so why don't you go get your uniform?

4
00:00:07,700 --> 00:00:08,360
动作快点啦
Chop chop!

5
00:00:08,460 --> 00:00:09,340
-小卡 -怎么了
- Cam. - What?

6
00:00:09,380 --> 00:00:11,040
她在学空手道 这样说没什么
She's in karate. It's not offensive.

7
00:00:11,300 --> 00:00:12,740
不一定 不过你为什么
Debatable, but why would you

8
00:00:12,740 --> 00:00:13,860
要把这些课外活动
schedule all this extra stuff

9
00:00:13,860 --> 00:00:15,078
跟她的才艺表演安排在同一天呢
on the same day as her talent show?

10
00:00:15,078 --> 00:00:17,619
你是在批评我给我们的音盲女儿
Okay, are you accusing me of overscheduling

11
00:00:17,619 --> 00:00:19,100
安排过满 导致她累得
our tone-deaf daughter so she's so tired

12
00:00:19,100 --> 00:00:21,620
错过了才艺表演 而没有丢人现眼吗
she misses the talent show and doesn't humiliate herself?

13
00:00:22,240 --> 00:00:23,278
莉莉没有什么才能
Lily has no talent.

14
00:00:23,278 --> 00:00:26,220
因为她才7岁 没有人7岁时就有才能
Because she's 7. No one has talent at 7.

15
00:00:26,220 --> 00:00:28,258
我就有 多得很
I did. Tons of it.

16
00:00:28,258 --> 00:00:30,760
薅羊毛 剥玉米 捆干草
Sheep-shearing, cornhusking, hay-baling.

17
00:00:30,760 --> 00:00:32,720
我第一次参加小王子选美时
It was hard for me to pick just one to showcase

18
00:00:32,720 --> 00:00:34,000
都不知道该选哪个做才艺展示
at my first little prince pageant.

19
00:00:34,120 --> 00:00:35,284
最后我跳了华尔兹
In the end, I went with waltzing.

20
00:00:35,284 --> 00:00:36,980
你7岁就跳华尔兹
You waltzed at 7?

21
00:00:36,980 --> 00:00:38,660
差不多吧 我搭档有两只左蹄
Barely. My partner had two left hooves.

22
00:00:40,120 --> 00:00:41,160
我拿到了
I got it!

23
00:00:41,420 --> 00:00:43,460
等等 我的才艺表演不是今天吗
Hey, wait. Isn't my talent show today?

24
00:00:43,520 --> 00:00:45,660
谁知道呢 我们去骑小马吧
Oh, who knows? But let's go ride some ponies.

25
00:00:45,740 --> 00:00:46,960
不不不 你说得对 就是今天
No, no, you're right. It is today,

26
00:00:46,960 --> 00:00:48,940
既然还要过会儿才上芭蕾课
and since you have a little bit of time before ballet...

27
00:00:49,300 --> 00:00:51,599
你们俩何不热热身呢
Why don't you two do a little bit of warming up?

28
00:00:51,599 --> 00:00:52,444
大师 来吧
Maestro? Come on.

29
00:00:52,444 --> 00:00:54,540
-好 太好了 谢谢 -来吧
- Oh, okay, great. Thank you. - Yeah, yeah.

30
00:00:54,540 --> 00:00:57,700
莉莉 你能跟我一起唱*C*
So, Lily, can you meet me here at... *C*

31
00:00:58,500 --> 00:00:58,873
*C*

32
00:00:58,873 --> 00:01:01,620
*你没有跟上大爸*
*Now daddy's lonely*

33
00:01:01,620 --> 00:01:02,800
*我跟上你了*
*I'm there with you*

34
00:01:02,900 --> 00:01:05,280
*不 你没有 差得远呢*
*No, you're not, you're not even close*

35
00:01:05,320 --> 00:01:07,780
*你听自己唱的也完全不一样吧*
*This can't possibly sound the same to you*

36
00:01:07,920 --> 00:01:11,550
*也许我能帮帮忙 小爸也来唱*
*Maybe I can help, daddy is also here at...*

37
00:01:11,550 --> 00:01:12,100
*C*

38
00:01:12,100 --> 00:01:12,620
*C*

39
00:01:12,800 --> 00:01:14,640
*不 这都不是一个音符*
*No, that's not even a note*

40
00:01:14,640 --> 00:01:16,460
*我觉得你是故意的*
*I feel like you're doing it on purpose*

41
00:01:16,680 --> 00:01:18,040
*这话有点刻薄[音有点高]*
*That seems a little bit sharp*

42
00:01:18,120 --> 00:01:20,200
*我从不走音 我是完美音准*
*I'm never sharp, I'm pitch-perfect*

43
00:01:20,760 --> 00:01:22,560
*我是说你对我们女儿的语气*
*I'm talking about your tone toward our daughter*

44
00:01:22,680 --> 00:01:25,200
*就算你们是用唱的 我也能听懂*
*I can understand you even when you're singing*

45
00:01:41,440 --> 00:01:43,280
你在干什么
What are you doing?

46
00:01:43,900 --> 00:01:48,180
我要把屋子里的所有奶嘴都收起来
I am gathering every binky that is in this house,

47
00:01:48,180 --> 00:01:52,320
因为从今天起 乔要开始戒奶嘴了
because from today on, Joe is going cold turkey.

48
00:01:53,360 --> 00:01:57,160
好了乔 你可以最后再吸一口
Okay, Joe, have your last puff if you want.

49
00:01:57,160 --> 00:01:59,600
歌洛莉亚 我在看节目呢
Gloria, I'm trying to watch something here.

50
00:02:00,540 --> 00:02:02,429
好 你想哭可以接着哭
Okay, you can keep crying all you want.

51
00:02:02,429 --> 00:02:05,540
我什么都听不到 试试在哥伦比亚长大
I can't hear anything. Try growing up in Colombia.

52
00:02:05,540 --> 00:02:07,720
我的奶嘴只是个火花塞
My binky was a spark plug.

53
00:02:08,480 --> 00:02:10,120
卢克 你怎么能忘了你的泳裤
Luke, how could you forget your bathing suit?

54
00:02:10,300 --> 00:02:11,374
你是来游泳的
You came over here to swim.

55
00:02:11,374 --> 00:02:12,960
没事啦 亲爱的 他可以穿我的
It's all right, honey. He can wear mine.

56
00:02:12,960 --> 00:02:13,760
我可以跟杰借
I'll borrow from Jay.

57
00:02:14,200 --> 00:02:16,440
有哪个你最爱的是我不能碰的吗 杰
You have a favorite I should keep my hands off of, Jay?

58
00:02:16,460 --> 00:02:18,260
早在20年前就被你碰了
That ship sailed about 20 years ago.

59
00:02:18,424 --> 00:02:19,783
说得好
Zinger!

60
00:02:20,180 --> 00:02:21,240
把这种魅力
Save some of that charm

61
00:02:21,240 --> 00:02:22,720
留到拍广告的时候再用吧 老爸
for our commercial shoot today, dad, huh?

62
00:02:27,177 --> 00:02:28,920
你看到对手是怎么做的了吗
You see what our competition's doing?

63
00:02:28,920 --> 00:02:30,019
看到那些滤镜 特效吗
See the lasers? Special effects?

64
00:02:30,019 --> 00:02:32,060
我打赌他们在那玩意上花了五百万
I'll bet they spent 5 million bucks on that thing.

65
00:02:32,060 --> 00:02:32,740
别担心 老爸
Don't worry, dad.

66
00:02:32,840 --> 00:02:35,180
我想出来的创意比他们的好多了
The concept I came up with is so much better than theirs.

67
00:02:35,200 --> 00:02:35,800
我们得放弃
We're scrapping it.

68
00:02:35,860 --> 00:02:37,339
什么 我为那个努力了两个月
What? I worked for two months on that.

69
00:02:37,339 --> 00:02:39,680
抱歉 我们得用证明确有成效的东西
Sorry. We gotta go with what's proven.

70
00:02:39,680 --> 00:02:41,300
重拍我以前的广告
We're remaking my old commercial.

71
00:02:41,740 --> 00:02:43,700
三十年前 我爸在本地登了一则
30 years ago, my dad was in a local ad

72
00:02:43,700 --> 00:02:44,620
普里契特橱柜的广告
for Pritchett's Closets,

73
00:02:44,620 --> 00:02:45,600
他一直为
and he has always been

74
00:02:45,600 --> 00:02:47,640
他想出来的广告语自豪
really proud of the slogan he came up with.

75
00:02:49,300 --> 00:02:50,540
我一直都不懂是什么意思
I've never understood what it means.

76
00:02:51,600 --> 00:02:52,320
普里契特橱柜
Pritchett's Closets --

77
00:02:52,880 --> 00:02:54,840
选择我们的九大奢华样板
Choose one of our nine luxurious models

78
00:02:55,080 --> 00:02:56,180
例如蒙特卡罗
like the Monte Carlo.

79
00:02:56,420 --> 00:02:57,940
或者采用顶尖技术
Or how about a custom design

80
00:02:57,940 --> 00:03:00,040
制造的专属定制衣柜
using our state-of-the-art technology?

81
00:03:00,600 --> 00:03:01,780
来普里契特
Come visit Pritchett's

82
00:03:01,780 --> 00:03:04,400
把梦想橱柜带回家
and go home with the closet of your dreams.

83
00:03:05,040 --> 00:03:06,780
买橱柜吗 你会爱上它
Closet? You'll love it!

84
00:03:08,760 --> 00:03:11,120
整个市区都为那则广告疯狂了
The entire town went nuts for that ad.

85
00:03:11,180 --> 00:03:12,620
人们在街上拦住我
People stopped me in the street,

86
00:03:12,620 --> 00:03:14,140
让我再说一遍那条广告语
asking me to say the slogan.

87
00:03:14,380 --> 00:03:16,120
你确定他们不是在让你解释清楚吗
Are you sure they weren't asking you to explain it?

88
00:03:16,200 --> 00:03:16,900
有什么好解释的
What's to explain?

89
00:03:17,220 --> 00:03:18,600
把"喜欢它吗 你会爱上它"
Instead of "Like it? You'll love it,"

90
00:03:18,600 --> 00:03:19,640
改成"买橱柜吗 你会爱上它"
you use the word "Closet."

91
00:03:19,640 --> 00:03:21,180
那何不说"喜欢它吗 你会买橱柜"
Then why not, "Like it? You'll closet!"?

92
00:03:21,340 --> 00:03:22,220
那样说不通
That makes no sense.

93
00:03:23,280 --> 00:03:25,680
听着 我知道有一个出名的的老爸
Look, I know it was rough on you and Mitch

94
00:03:25,680 --> 00:03:26,599
让你和米奇很痛苦
having a famous dad,

95
00:03:26,599 --> 00:03:28,291
在饭店里被拍照
you know, getting your picture taken in restaurants.

96
00:03:28,291 --> 00:03:30,440
只有一次 老爸 只是因为你跟
That happened one time, dad. Only because you were

97
00:03:30,440 --> 00:03:32,400
车库门遥控器之王拉尔夫·伯曼在一起
with Ralph Berman, "Garage door opener king."

98
00:03:32,460 --> 00:03:34,180
是他跟我们在一起
Hey, he was eating with us.

99
00:03:34,920 --> 00:03:35,840
重点是
The point is,

100
00:03:35,840 --> 00:03:38,176
那则广告很成功 也会再次成功的
that ad scored for us, and it will again.

101
00:03:38,176 --> 00:03:40,260
所以就要放弃我的全部努力
So we're gonna flush all my hard work

102
00:03:40,260 --> 00:03:42,080
就因为你被那个都称不上朗朗上口的
because you got freaked out by some commercial

103
00:03:42,080 --> 00:03:43,220
广告歌给吓到了吗
that's not even that catchy.

104
00:03:44,102 --> 00:03:46,275
*衣柜衣柜*
*Closets, closets*

105
00:03:47,860 --> 00:03:49,700
好了 进去
All right, get there!

106
00:03:52,600 --> 00:03:54,840
如果你真想等贝丝来了之后 让她感动
Hey, if you really wanna impress Beth when she gets here,

107
00:03:54,860 --> 00:03:56,360
你应该试试赢那只大象
you should try for that giant elephant.

108
00:03:57,220 --> 00:03:58,500
企鹅也不错
Oh, penguin's just as good.

109
00:04:02,140 --> 00:04:02,553
进了
Money!

110
00:04:02,553 --> 00:04:05,686
我花了很多钱 很多
I just spent a lot of money. A lot.

111
00:04:05,686 --> 00:04:08,220
抱歉 有点工作上的事
Sorry. I had to check in at the job.

112
00:04:08,220 --> 00:04:09,460
店里总是有事
Always something going down at the Hut.

113
00:04:09,540 --> 00:04:10,620
你在the Hut上班啊
You work at the Hut?

114
00:04:11,100 --> 00:04:12,540
我本想猜必胜客
I would guess pizza,

115
00:04:12,640 --> 00:04:14,380
但是根据当你帮我从游览船上
but based on your ripply stomach I saw

116
00:04:14,380 --> 00:04:15,960
下来时我看到的你平坦的腹部
when you helped me get down off the gondola ride,

117
00:04:15,960 --> 00:04:18,213
我猜是 墨镜客
I'm gonna guess... Sunglass Hut.

118
00:04:18,213 --> 00:04:20,425
是啊 蔡斯挑了这副古董墨镜
Yep, Chase picked out these vintage-y sunglasses

119
00:04:20,425 --> 00:04:21,740
我戴起来看上去像是在70年代的
that look like I could've been murdered

120
00:04:21,740 --> 00:04:23,240
酷炫派对上会被谋杀的对象
at a cool house party in the '70s.

121
00:04:23,560 --> 00:04:24,960
你被陷害了[加了外框]
Ooh, you've been framed.

122
00:04:25,760 --> 00:04:27,400
你该用这句
You should use that.

123
00:04:27,920 --> 00:04:28,910
你在墨镜客工作时可以用
At your job at the Hut.

124
00:04:28,910 --> 00:04:30,980
你刚说了赫特人贾巴[音似]
You just said "Jabba the Hut."

125
00:04:30,980 --> 00:04:32,280
我真的搞不懂了 两位
I'm really lost here, guys.

126
00:04:34,188 --> 00:04:34,868
真疼
That smarts.

127
00:04:34,868 --> 00:04:38,807
-又来吗 -是啊 可能只是晕动病
- Again? - Yeah. Uh, it's probably just motion sickness.

128
00:04:38,807 --> 00:04:41,220
是啊 动作是整天往嘴里塞
Uh, yeah, the motion of shoving deep fried garbage

129
00:04:41,220 --> 00:04:42,080
油炸垃圾食品
in your mouth all day.

130
00:04:42,080 --> 00:04:44,960
又是我经理 她总是盯着我
It's my manager again. She's always on me.

131
00:04:44,980 --> 00:04:46,800
等不及到秋天她去上大学的时候了
Can't wait till the fall when she's off to college.

132
00:04:47,360 --> 00:04:48,180
什么事 莫琳
Yeah, Maureen?

133
00:04:50,920 --> 00:04:51,500
贝丝不来了
Beth's not coming.

134
00:04:51,940 --> 00:04:53,940
她太累了 不想从圣地亚哥一路开过来
She's too tired to drive up from San Diego.

135
00:04:54,620 --> 00:04:57,500
这个我从来没见过的贝丝
So this Beth, who I've never actually met,

136
00:04:57,540 --> 00:04:59,900
她是真正的活生生的姑娘吗
is she one of those real-life move-around girls?

137
00:05:01,495 --> 00:05:03,129
她是真正的姑娘
No, she is a real girl.

138
00:05:03,300 --> 00:05:06,040
好吧 但她都大老远飞来
Fine, but, you know, she flew all the way over here

139
00:05:06,040 --> 00:05:07,460
进行海岸警卫队训练了
for some coast guard training.

140
00:05:07,460 --> 00:05:09,260
她都没法开几小时车来见你吗
She can't drive a couple hours to see you?

141
00:05:09,320 --> 00:05:11,275
她一早上都在拯救溺水的人体模型
She's been saving drowning mannequins all morning,

142
00:05:11,275 --> 00:05:13,200
有些是特大号的
and some of them are plus-sized,

143
00:05:13,200 --> 00:05:15,040
因为很多人是从游艇上掉下来
because a lot of people fall off cruise ships.

144
00:05:15,640 --> 00:05:17,780
好吧 但她都放了你一百次鸽子了
Okay, but doesn't it bother you

145
00:05:17,780 --> 00:05:19,640
你难道就不觉得不爽吗
that she's flaked for, like, the hundredth time?

146
00:05:19,900 --> 00:05:21,780
我知道你不喜欢贝丝
I know you have a problem with Beth,

147
00:05:21,780 --> 00:05:24,400
但我俩的关系在我看来挺好 好吗
but what we have works for me, okay?

148
00:05:25,020 --> 00:05:26,300
如果我们要进行指责[伸出手指]
And if we're pointing fingers...

149
00:05:26,300 --> 00:05:29,669
我需要你帮我找钥匙
I want you to help me find my keys.

150
00:05:29,669 --> 00:05:30,831
等等
Wait. Shh.

151
00:05:31,040 --> 00:05:32,480
-在我的外套里 -好吧
- They're in my jacket. - Okay.

152
00:05:32,600 --> 00:05:33,320
知道了
Got it.

153
00:05:36,480 --> 00:05:38,380
妈妈 那个变态又在盯着你看了
Mom, that perv is ogling you again.

154
00:05:38,460 --> 00:05:40,660
没有 我在读星座运势
No! I was reading my horoscope.

155
00:05:40,660 --> 00:05:43,319
"你今天会借一件超大的泳衣" 什么
"You will borrow a huge swimsuit today." What?

156
00:05:43,319 --> 00:05:45,920
不 是飞机
Ay, no, the plane!

157
00:05:45,920 --> 00:05:49,104
那架飞机 总是在偷窥我
The plane! It's always spying on me!

158
00:05:49,220 --> 00:05:51,020
走开 不然我要报警了
Go away or I'm gonna call the policeman!

159
00:05:51,440 --> 00:05:53,600
别浪费时间 歌洛莉亚
Wow, don't even waste your time, Gloria.

160
00:05:53,740 --> 00:05:55,399
警察可搞不定用这种飞机的人
Johnny Law's got no chance with that baby.

161
00:05:55,399 --> 00:05:56,858
这是一架云端凝视机
You're looking at a freeling cloudgazer

162
00:05:56,858 --> 00:05:59,620
配备后市倒频器 无法追踪
with after-market frequency scrambler. Untraceable.

163
00:05:59,620 --> 00:06:01,320
你大概能猜出 我也是无人机爱好者
As you can guess, I'm a droner myself.

164
00:06:01,500 --> 00:06:03,120
是啊 你现在就在嗡嗡嗡
Yes, you're droning right now.

165
00:06:03,337 --> 00:06:05,340
越来越近了
Ay, it's getting closer!

166
00:06:05,340 --> 00:06:06,540
妈妈 也许你该盖住身子
Mom, maybe you should cover up.

167
00:06:06,600 --> 00:06:07,900
不 那太疯狂了
No! That's crazy.

168
00:06:07,900 --> 00:06:09,140
我们可以把它打下来
We can just knock it out of the sky.

169
00:06:09,280 --> 00:06:10,220
曼尼 拿着水管
Manny, grab the hose.

170
00:06:12,000 --> 00:06:13,440
我来弄瞎它
I'll use this to blind it.

171
00:06:14,220 --> 00:06:15,120
我的眼睛
My eyes!

172
00:06:15,680 --> 00:06:16,640
我的眼睛
My eyes!

173
00:06:22,200 --> 00:06:24,740
就那样 它消失了
And just like that, it disappears.

174
00:06:24,988 --> 00:06:27,818
