绿袖是加州南部
The Greensleevers were Southern California's

195
00:07:19,500 --> 00:07:20,580
最棒的假日合唱团
premier holiday chorus

196
00:07:20,660 --> 00:07:22,880
12月23日的《洛杉矶时报》
and "Just the nutmeg we want

197
