354
00:13:23,930 --> 00:13:25,029
我们这么做没错
Hey, we're doing the right thing.

355
00:13:25,029 --> 00:13:27,510
人在7岁就能形成重大的心理创伤了
You can develop deep emotional scars at age 7.

356
00:13:27,510 --> 00:13:28,450
我到现在都吃不了
I still can't eat--

357
00:13:28,450 --> 00:13:29,890
盐醋味薯片 我知道
Salt and vinegar chips. Yes, I know.

358
00:13:29,890 --> 00:13:31,610
我现在没空跟你回想过去
I can't relive this with you right now.

359
00:13:31,630 --> 00:13:33,750
抱歉
I'm sorry. Okay.

360
00:13:33,830 --> 00:13:34,650
看看她
Look at her.

361
00:13:35,579 --> 00:13:38,490
是啊 原来她连用嘴接东西都不会
Yeah. Add mouth-catching to things she can't do.

362
00:13:38,490 --> 00:13:40,850
不是这个 她完全不紧张
No. I mean, she's not nervous at all,

363
00:13:40,850 --> 00:13:42,590
看看其他的孩子 他们都慌得不行
and look at the other kids. They're a wreck.

364
00:13:42,810 --> 00:13:44,170
也许她没有继承我们的天赋
You know, she may not have gotten our talent,

365
00:13:44,610 --> 00:13:46,590
但她也没有我们这么在意别人的看法
but she didn't get our self-consciousness either.

366
00:13:48,041 --> 00:13:49,811
这一点我们还是不要强加给她了
Well, we're not giving her our self-consciousness.

367
00:13:49,811 --> 00:13:52,310
今天是她的大好日子 而她
Today is her day, and she is--

368
00:13:52,310 --> 00:13:54,990
她要唱歌 来吧
she is gonna sing. Come on.

369
00:14:01,370 --> 00:14:04,230
大家好 我妈妈在做化疗
Hi, my mom's doing chemo,

370
00:14:04,330 --> 00:14:06,790
所以我剃了头发 看起来和她一样
so I shaved my head to be like her.

371
00:14:07,210 --> 00:14:08,790
这首歌献给你 妈妈
This is for you, mom.

372
00:14:09,724 --> 00:14:13,450
*而我*
*And I*

373
00:14:13,450 --> 00:14:13,970
*我*
*I*

374
00:14:16,210 --> 00:14:20,230
*会一直爱你*
*Will always love you*

375
00:14:21,150 --> 00:14:22,730
有麻烦了
Hey, hey, we got a problem.

376
00:14:22,870 --> 00:14:23,690
怎么了 宝贝
What's wrong, sweetie?

377
00:14:23,810 --> 00:14:25,670
-我不能在她后面唱啊 -你没搞错吧
- I can't go after her. - Are you kidding?

378
00:14:26,830 --> 00:14:29,790
亲爱的 我们不能就这样走了
Okay, well, honey, we can't just leave right now.

379
00:14:29,790 --> 00:14:33,070
我们得走了 玛娅有点发烧
Sorry, gotta run. Maya's feeling a bit feverish.

380
00:14:33,290 --> 00:14:35,750
看来有些人受不了激烈的赛况啊
Oh, well, I guess some people can't take the heat.

381
00:14:37,491 --> 00:14:39,063
*会一直爱你*
*Will always love you*

382
00:14:39,063 --> 00:14:40,740
-你信吗 -当然不信
- Can you believe that? - No.

383
00:14:41,310 --> 00:14:42,930
行了 撤吧 从偏门出去
Okay, now we can leave. Let's go out the side door.

384
00:14:43,712 --> 00:14:45,071
老爸 我
Hey, dad, I--

385
00:14:45,230 --> 00:14:47,790
我试着在拍摄之后找你
I tried to grab you after the shoot,

386
00:14:47,790 --> 00:14:48,810
但你就那么消失了
but you just flew out of there.

387
00:14:48,910 --> 00:14:50,150
我不想看起来好像要
I didn't want it to seem like

388
00:14:50,150 --> 00:14:51,548
留在那里听你们的赞美
I was hanging around for compliments.

389
00:14:51,548 --> 00:14:54,290
你走之后我们讨论了一下
There, there was some discussion after you left.

390
00:14:54,290 --> 00:14:55,290
去别家吧 小伙子
Keep it moving, buddy!

391
00:14:56,990 --> 00:14:59,530
有几个人觉得你有些
A-a few people feel that you came across a little--

392
00:14:59,530 --> 00:15:01,390
牌子上写了"不要乱发小广告"
Sign says "No menus"!

393
00:15:02,438 --> 00:15:03,534
你刚才说什么
What'd you say?

394
00:15:04,970 --> 00:15:06,310
大家都觉得
The group thinks

395
00:15:06,310 --> 00:15:08,590
如果换一个代言人
that maybe it would be for the best

396
00:15:08,590 --> 00:15:11,950
会对公司有好处
if, if someone else was our spokesman.

397
00:15:11,950 --> 00:15:13,589
公司名叫普利契特衣柜
It's called Pritchett's Closets.

398
00:15:13,589 --> 00:15:15,610
我知道 但有时候你有点
Yeah, I know, but you were coming off

399
00:15:15,610 --> 00:15:17,330
-就一丁点 -这些小混蛋
- just a tiny bit - Damn kids.

400
00:15:17,390 --> 00:15:18,190
球现在是我的了
It's mine now!

401
00:15:18,750 --> 00:15:20,170
-有点暴躁 -暴躁
- Tiny bit grumpy. - Grumpy?

402
00:15:20,410 --> 00:15:21,830
凶一点没什么关系
There's nothing wrong with being a little gruff.

403
00:15:21,930 --> 00:15:23,272
这就是你的性格
That's how you are.

404
00:15:23,272 --> 00:15:24,830
-但在销售方面 老爸 -你说什么
- But when it comes to selling, dad-- - What do you mean?

405
00:15:24,830 --> 00:15:25,910
你说"我的性格"是什么意思
What do you mean, how I am?

406
00:15:26,270 --> 00:15:28,150
大家就是这么看我的 觉得我很凶吗
Is that what people think of me, that I'm some big grump?

407
00:15:28,310 --> 00:15:30,090
老爸 你不会这么惊讶吧
Dad, that cannot be a big shock

408
00:15:30,090 --> 00:15:31,370
毕竟孩子们都叫你"暴脾气外公"
that kids call you "Grumpa."

409
00:15:31,430 --> 00:15:31,970
从什么时候开始的
Since when?

410
00:15:32,370 --> 00:15:33,690
他们居然没当着你面说
Not to your face?

411
00:15:34,470 --> 00:15:34,910
胆小鬼
Cowards.

412
00:15:34,910 --> 00:15:36,690
如果我是"暴脾气"
So if I get "Grumpa,"

413
00:15:37,550 --> 00:15:38,850
菲尔他爸又得了个什么称呼
what do they call Phil's dad?

414
00:15:39,210 --> 00:15:42,030
"欢乐多"
You know, just "Funpa."

415
00:15:42,290 --> 00:15:45,305
那个蠢货居然叫"欢乐多"
That mound of human silly string gets "Funpa"?

416
00:15:45,305 --> 00:15:46,330
这不是重点
That's not the issue, dad.

417
00:15:46,330 --> 00:15:47,630
我知道重点是什么
No, no, I know what the issue is.

418
00:15:47,890 --> 00:15:49,890
你是说我不近人情
You're saying I'm not warm and cuddly enough

419
00:15:49,890 --> 00:15:50,990
不适合卖衣柜
to sell closets anymore.

420
00:15:51,330 --> 00:15:53,650
所有父亲都预见到这天
It's a day that every father knows may come

421
00:15:53,650 --> 00:15:54,824
但他们都希望这天永不会来
but hopes it never will.

422
00:15:54,824 --> 00:15:56,570
你确定所有的父亲
Are we sure every father--

423
00:15:56,570 --> 00:15:57,750
别说了
Stop hurting me!

424
00:16:01,970 --> 00:16:04,070
你感觉怎么样
Hey, how you feeling?

425
00:16:07,250 --> 00:16:08,870
看起来手术前
Oh, looks like they got you

426
00:16:08,870 --> 00:16:10,950
他们给你下了不少猛药啊
on a bunch of good drugs before your surgery.

427
00:16:11,910 --> 00:16:13,930
我就是来看看你
I just came in to check on you.

428
00:16:13,950 --> 00:16:16,070
你一个人经历这些肯定很害怕吧
Pretty scary going through this all by yourself.

429
00:16:17,130 --> 00:16:19,350
你女朋友不在真是太可怜了
Too bad your girlfriend couldn't be here.

430
00:16:19,350 --> 00:16:21,050
贝丝是真人
Beth is real.

431
00:16:21,050 --> 00:16:22,430
我知道
I know that.

432
00:16:22,710 --> 00:16:23,310
不
No.

433
00:16:23,834 --> 00:16:25,866
贝丝是真人
Beth is real.

434
00:16:25,866 --> 00:16:28,390
好吧 你真的想谈谈吗
Okay, you really wanna talk about it?

435
00:16:28,390 --> 00:16:30,230
你们俩的关系又有多真呢
How real is your relationship?

436
00:16:30,910 --> 00:16:33,850
真的感情是当某人发现你进了医院
Real is when someone finds out that you're in the hospital

437
00:16:33,850 --> 00:16:36,710
她会放下所有事赶来 因为她不想
and drops everything because she doesn't want you

438
00:16:36,710 --> 00:16:38,130
让你一个人承受这一切
to be freaked out and alone.

439
00:16:38,990 --> 00:16:41,230
我不想伤害你
Look, I'm not trying to be mean.

440
00:16:41,370 --> 00:16:43,690
只是你有没有想过
It's just, you ever think you might be

441
00:16:43,690 --> 00:16:45,130
你可能太委屈自己了呢
settling for something here?

442
00:16:48,520 --> 00:16:50,297
我们都做过这种事
We've-we've all done it.

443
00:16:50,570 --> 00:16:51,990
跟自己说企鹅也挺好的
Talked ourselves into the penguin

444
00:16:51,990 --> 00:16:53,970
因为觉得自己得不到大象
because we didn't think we had a shot at the elephant.

445
00:17:01,750 --> 00:17:03,030
如果我就是你的大象
If I'm your elephant,

446
00:17:03,070 --> 00:17:03,910
你是可以追到我的
you have a shot.

447
00:17:04,410 --> 00:17:05,970
我想说的就是这个 傻瓜
That's what I'm trying to say, dummy.

448
00:17:08,450 --> 00:17:10,046
他终于睡着了 真好
I'm glad he's finally asleep.

449
00:17:10,046 --> 00:17:12,550
他进来以后一直在喊贝丝·以姿丽
He kept going on about Beth Israel in hospital.

450
00:17:12,550 --> 00:17:13,730
我跟他说了他的保险没问题
I told him his insurance is fine.

451
00:17:13,750 --> 00:17:14,810
我们可以在这里做手术
We can do the surgery here.

452
00:17:14,950 --> 00:17:15,750
贝丝·以姿丽
Beth Israel?

453
00:17:16,856 --> 00:17:19,630
天呐 安迪 你还好吗
Oh, my god. Andy, are you okay?

454
00:17:19,630 --> 00:17:20,668
他没事吧
He's okay, right?

455
00:17:20,668 --> 00:17:22,470
是的 他在睡觉
Uh, yeah, he's sleeping.

456
00:17:22,470 --> 00:17:23,170
谢天谢地
Oh, thank god.

457
00:17:23,384 --> 00:17:25,139
我是贝丝 安迪的女朋友
I'm Beth, Andy's girlfriend.

458
00:17:25,139 --> 00:17:27,310
你好 我是海莉
Oh. Hi. Uh, Haley.

459
00:17:27,310 --> 00:17:28,270
是你啊
Of course.

460
00:17:28,890 --> 00:17:30,510
安迪跟我说了很多关于你的事
Andy's told me so much about you.

461
00:17:31,010 --> 00:17:32,450
很抱歉没赶上嘉年华
I'm so sorry about missing the carnival.

462
00:17:32,550 --> 00:17:33,830
我已经连续两天没睡觉了
I've just been up for two days straight.

463
00:17:34,630 --> 00:17:37,230
既然你来了 那我就先走了
Well, you're here, so I should go.

464
00:17:37,590 --> 00:17:38,890
好的 谢谢你
Okay. Thanks again.

465
00:17:50,910 --> 00:17:51,923
你听 你听
Listen, listen.

466
00:17:51,923 --> 00:17:54,270
起作用了 他不哭了
It worked. He stopped crying.

467
00:17:54,270 --> 00:17:56,431
真好 我很高兴 听我说
Oh, so good for him. I'm glad. So listen.

468
00:17:56,431 --> 00:17:57,930
这些帅哥靓妹是谁啊
Who are these beautiful people?

469
00:17:57,930 --> 00:17:59,030
一定是你的表亲吧
They must be cousins of yours?

470
00:17:59,270 --> 00:18:00,110
是的 他们是...
Yes, they are --

471
00:18:00,490 --> 00:18:01,830
等一下
Wait a minute.

472
00:18:02,630 --> 00:18:04,230
你把它关掉了
You turned it off.

473
00:18:04,230 --> 00:18:07,290
我还以为他终于不再想要他的奶嘴了呢
And I thought that he was finally getting over his binky!

474
00:18:07,670 --> 00:18:09,989
哭声简直要让我发狂了
The screaming is driving me crazy!

475
00:18:09,989 --> 00:18:12,670
那哭声让每个人都要发狂了 歌洛莉亚
The screaming is driving everyone crazy, Gloria.

476
00:18:12,670 --> 00:18:13,930
要么你把这个关掉
You either have to turn this thing off,

477
00:18:13,930 --> 00:18:14,750
要么我就到楼上去
or I'm going up there

478
00:18:14,750 --> 00:18:16,369
把我的钥匙给他含着
and giving him my keys to suck on.

479
00:18:16,369 --> 00:18:19,215
我美丽的太太今天怎么样
Hey-o! How's my beautiful wife?

480
00:18:19,570 --> 00:18:21,650
发生什么事了 你为什么这副表情
What happened? Why do you look like that?

481
00:18:21,730 --> 00:18:22,870
我只是很高兴见到你
I'm just happy to see you.

482
00:18:23,090 --> 00:18:24,490
你看起来像个疯子
You look like a crazy person.

483
00:18:24,490 --> 00:18:26,070
爸 你对你的脸做了什么 说吧
Dad, what are you doing with your face? Come on.

484
00:18:26,190 --> 00:18:28,150
没有人发现乔已经不哭了吗
Did anyone else notice that Joe stopped crying?

485
00:18:28,610 --> 00:18:30,810
没看完才艺表演就回来了 别问为什么
Back from the talent show early. Don't ask why.

486
00:18:30,870 --> 00:18:32,250
我喜欢看孩子们的才艺表演
I love it when children have talent.

487
00:18:32,390 --> 00:18:33,590
你为什么要那样笑
Why are you smiling like that?

488
00:18:33,610 --> 00:18:34,890
是不是妈妈出什么事了
Did something happen to mom?

489
00:18:35,330 --> 00:18:37,730
把你的脸恢复成原来的样子
Put your face back to what it used to be.

490
00:18:37,750 --> 00:18:39,130
拜托 爸爸 别这样
Come on, dad. Just drop it.

491
00:18:39,170 --> 00:18:39,950
所以现在我又太开心了
So now I'm too happy.

492
00:18:40,031 --> 00:18:42,190
你们到底想怎么样
Make up your damn minds!

493
00:18:42,390 --> 00:18:43,210
这样才对嘛
There he is.

494
00:18:44,530 --> 00:18:45,690
我来解决
I've got it.

495
00:18:49,430 --> 00:18:52,510
爸爸 对不起 我并不是想让你心烦
Dad, I'm sorry. I didn't mean to upset you.

496
00:18:52,510 --> 00:18:53,270
省省吧 克莱尔
Save it, Claire.

497
00:18:54,430 --> 00:18:56,450
我看了今天我们拍的片子
I watched what we shot today.

498
00:18:57,130 --> 00:18:58,510
没错 我已经不再是30年前
Yeah, I'm not that cheery,

499
00:18:58,790 --> 00:19:00,650
那个快乐 可爱的名人了
likeable celebrity I was 30 years ago.

500
00:19:01,362 --> 00:19:03,156
我现在是个臭脾气老头
I am an old grump now.

501
00:19:03,890 --> 00:19:04,930
我什么时候变成这样的
When did I turn that corner?

502
00:19:05,130 --> 00:19:06,510
你没有 你没有
You haven't. You haven't.

503
00:19:06,550 --> 00:19:07,950
我是说 你在慢慢变成那样
I mean, you're creeping up to it.

504
00:19:08,010 --> 00:19:10,590
你开了转向灯了 不过还没有转弯
You got your blinker on, but...you haven't yet.

505
00:19:10,890 --> 00:19:12,390
我在我爸爸身上看到过这种变化
I saw it happen to my dad, you know?

506
00:19:13,013 --> 00:19:16,050
前一天 他还是乐天派的旋转钻机操作员
One day, hap-go-lucky rotary drill operator,

507
00:19:16,512 --> 00:19:18,232
第二天他就把啤酒瓶扔到电视机上了
the next he's rowing his Schlitz at the TV

508
00:19:18,232 --> 00:19:20,796
就因为体育节目解说员是女的
'cause some lady sportscaster came on.

509
00:19:21,590 --> 00:19:23,390
我曾发誓永远不要变成他那样
I swore I'd never be like that.

510
00:19:23,710 --> 00:19:25,030
你没那么糟 如果你真那么糟
You're not that bad. If you were,

511
00:19:25,090 --> 00:19:27,049
我们怎么会没事都到你这里来呢
why would we all spend all our time over here?

512
00:19:27,049 --> 00:19:28,757
你们来就是为了去泳池游泳
Oh, you just come here for the pool.

513
00:19:28,757 --> 00:19:31,138
才不是... 才不是那样
That's not...That's not true.

514
00:19:31,490 --> 00:19:32,370
不 才不是呢
No. Crazy.

515
00:19:34,470 --> 00:19:36,930
爸爸 你离变成爷爷那样还远着呢
Dad, you are a long way from turning into grandpa.

516
00:19:37,410 --> 00:19:38,950
知道吗 他第一次
You know, I was with him

517
00:19:38,950 --> 00:19:42,330
在超市看到寿司时 我跟他在一起
the first time he saw sushi in the grocery store.

518
00:19:42,770 --> 00:19:44,190
他拿起结账用的扫码器
He grabbed the price check mic

519
00:19:44,190 --> 00:19:46,490
给我们做了关于日本偷袭珍珠港的演讲
and treated us all to a little lecture on Pearl Harbor.

520
00:19:47,270 --> 00:19:49,230
你只需要再努力一些就可以了
You just have to fight it a little.

521
00:19:49,230 --> 00:19:50,510
感谢你这样说 宝贝
I appreciate it, honey.

522
00:19:51,390 --> 00:19:52,510
我不太确定
I'm not sure some of this

523
00:19:52,510 --> 00:19:54,790
可能这就是自然规律
just isn't natural order of things.

524
00:19:55,518 --> 00:19:57,510
敌人在十点钟方向 行动起来
Bogey at 10:00! Move it!

525
00:19:57,510 --> 00:19:58,450
这不是训练
This is not a drill!

526
00:19:58,970 --> 00:19:59,410
什么
What?

527
00:20:01,150 --> 00:20:02,600
先生们 听我倒数
Gentlemen, on my count,

528
00:20:02,600 --> 00:20:04,815
让我们释放战争恶魔
let slip the dogs of war!

529
00:20:06,370 --> 00:20:08,590
你们三个在这儿干什么呢
What the hell are you three doing out here?!

530
00:20:09,910 --> 00:20:12,010
我们如果想成功的话
Now if we have a prayer at this thing,

531
00:20:12,430 --> 00:20:13,730
必须呈三角形站好
we have to triangulate.

532
00:20:14,310 --> 00:20:14,990
菲尔 你站着别动
Phil, stay where you are.

533
00:20:15,050 --> 00:20:16,337
卢克 站到树旁 给我几个橙子
Luke, by the tree. Give me some of those oranges.

534
00:20:16,337 --> 00:20:16,670
给你
Here you go.

